  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    # Count zeros and non-zeros\n    z = 0\n    n = 0\n    for r in range(len(grid)):\n        for c in range(len(grid[r])):\n            if grid[r][c] == 0:\n                z += 1\n            else:\n                n += 1\n                \n    # Output size is 3*z by 3*z\n    out_size = 3 * z\n    out = [[0] * out_size for _ in range(out_size)]\n    \n    # Place n copies of the input grid\n    for i in range(n):\n        br = i // z\n        bc = i % z\n        for r in range(len(grid)):\n            for c in range(len(grid[r])):\n                out[br * len(grid) + r][bc * len(grid[0]) + c] = grid[r][c]\n                \n    return out\n```",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    # Count zeros and non-zeros\n    z = 0\n    n = 0\n    for r in range(len(grid)):\n        for c in range(len(grid[r])):\n            if grid[r][c] == 0:\n                z += 1\n            else:\n                n += 1\n                \n    # Output size is 3*z by 3*z\n    out_size = 3 * z\n    out = [[0] * out_size for _ in range(out_size)]\n    \n    # Place n copies of the input grid\n    for i in range(n):\n        br = i // z\n        bc = i % z\n        for r in range(len(grid)):\n            for c in range(len(grid[r])):\n                out[br * len(grid) + r][bc * len(grid[0]) + c] = grid[r][c]\n                \n    return out",
